@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@policyId = 598128
@policyNumber = 312608-0438

### Ultimas polizas
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies?page=1&pageSize=25

### Buscar como el modal de OMNIS
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies?number=312608&page=1&pageSize=100

### Buscar por fecha
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies?date=2026-08-24&page=1&pageSize=25

### Buscar por aplicada, familia y cheque
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies?applied=true&family=GASTOS%20MULTIPLES&cheque=GN5441&page=1&pageSize=25

### Cargar poliza por identificador
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies/{{policyId}}

### Cargar poliza por numero
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies/by-number/{{policyNumber}}

### Poliza anterior
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies/{{policyId}}/previous

### Poliza siguiente
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies/{{policyId}}/next

### Accion: Clasificar
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies/{{policyId}}/actions/classifications

### Guardar el AGTNUM elegido en PostgreSQL de pruebas. Usa summary.revision del GET y un UUID nuevo por cambio.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies/{{policyId}}/actions/classifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "compositeCode": "{{policyClassifierCompositeCode}}",
  "revision": {{policyClassifierRevision}},
  "requestKey": "{{policyClassifierRequestKey}}"
}

### Duplicar una póliza ordinaria, consultar la fecha y revisión de la fuente
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies/{{policyId}}/actions/duplicate

### Confirmar la copia en PostgreSQL de pruebas
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies/{{policyId}}/actions/duplicate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "{{activeFiscalDate}}",
  "revision": "{{duplicateRevision}}",
  "requestKey": "{{duplicateRequestKey}}",
  "confirmed": true
}
### Comentarios de una póliza
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies/{{policyId}}/actions/comments

### Guardar la cabecera y comentarios de una póliza web desaplicada
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounting/policies/{{manualPolicyId}}/actions/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{commentsRequestKey}}",
  "revision": {{manualPolicyRevision}},
  "fields": {
    "date": "2025-02-15",
    "cheque": "REF-1",
    "report": "",
    "postDate": null,
    "origin": "DIARIO",
    "beneficiary": "TUVANSA",
    "family": "DIARIO",
    "concept": "Comentarios de diario",
    "amountInWords": "",
    "comments": ["Nota de prueba", "", "", "", "", ""]
  }
}
